    "sections": {
        "description": "Vitrena turns a WooCommerce store into a showroom. Every product stands as an exhibit on a lit plinth beside a museum label read from the product itself: its maker, its key figures, its warranty, what comes in the box and whether it is ex-display. Departments read like a catalogue's contents, makers form an A to Z register, pieces line up side by side for comparison, and the sections number themselves. Bodoni Moda and Instrument Sans, four style variations, five section styles and 28 patterns. Creates no content and makes no external request."
    },
